<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <ThingDef Abstract="True" Name="MAP_MechanoidMechanitorInstallableModuleBase" ParentName="MechanitorImplantBase">
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <techLevel>Archotech</techLevel>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>100</MaxHitPoints>
      <Beauty>2</Beauty>
      <DeteriorationRate>0</DeteriorationRate>
      <Mass>1</Mass>
      <MarketValue>5000</MarketValue>
    </statBases>
    <comps Inherit="False">
      <li Class="CompProperties_Forbiddable"/>
      <li Class="MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.CompProperties_InstallableMechanoidModule"/>
    </comps>
    <thingCategories Inherit="False">
      <li>MAP_MechanoidMechanitorItems</li>
    </thingCategories>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="MAP_MechanoidMechanitorInstallableModuleBase">
    <defName>MAP_AutonomousDirectiveCore</defName>
    <label>自律指令核心</label>
    <description>以超凡技术赋予机械体自我意识的核心装置。其处理器能够支撑完整而稳定的机械心智，让机械体不再依赖外部监管，自主感知、思考并作出决定，成为拥有独立意志的个体。\n\n安装后，机械体将成为机械族机械师，获得监管与指挥其他机械族的能力。它基本可以视为一名独立的殖民地成员，参与生产、科研、战斗与远行，承担普通殖民者能够完成的大多数工作与活动。\n\n选中机械族，右键点击此物品即可下达安装命令。</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/AutonomousDirectiveCore</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>1.0</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>ExoticMisc</li>
    </tradeTags>
    <comps>
      <li Class="MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.CompProperties_AutonomousDirectiveCoreInstallEffect"/>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="MAP_MechanoidMechanitorInstallableModuleBase">
    <defName>MAP_BionicCompanionModule</defName>
    <label>仿生伴侣模块</label>
    <description>一种整合了情感模拟与仿生孕育技术的机械族模块。安装后，机械体能够与指定的殖民者结为配偶，并可开启亲密互动功能。对于生活在边缘世界的人们而言，这些复杂的回路承载着一个朴素的愿望：有人相伴，有所牵挂，让平凡的日子也值得期待。\n\n安装模块的机械族能够与配偶进行爱爱，并通过内置的人造子宫孕育后代。是否生育及孩子的性别均可自行设定。后代将继承人类配偶的全部基因（是否继承异种基因由MOD设置决定）。精密的孕育调控使诞生的孩子拥有更强的身体素质与学习潜力，为这份陪伴带来新的希望。\n\n选中机械族，右键点击此物品即可下达安装命令。</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/BionicCompanionModule</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>1.0</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <comps>
      <li Class="MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.CompProperties_BionicCompanionModuleInstallEffect"/>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="MAP_MechanoidMechanitorInstallableModuleBase">
    <defName>MAP_ReactionlessThruster</defName>
    <label>无工质推进器</label>
    <description>利用场推进技术产生推力的机械族模块，无需喷射推进工质即可驱动机体升空。安装后，机械族将获得自主飞行能力，飞行时仍需消耗自身能量。\n\n选中机械族，右键点击此物品即可下达安装命令。已拥有自主飞行能力的机械族无法重复安装。</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/FieldPropulsion</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>1.0</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <comps>
      <li Class="MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.CompProperties_ReactionlessThrusterInstallEffect"/>
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="MAP_MechanoidMechanitorInstallableModuleBase" MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Biotech">
    <defName>MAP_MindMappingAutonomousDirectiveCore</defName>
    <label>自律指令核心（空白）</label>
    <description>TODO</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/AutonomousDirectiveCore</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>1.0</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <comps Inherit="False">
      <li Class="CompProperties_Forbiddable"/>
      <li Class="MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.CompProperties_MindMappingAutonomousDirectiveCore"/>
    </comps>
    <inspectorTabs>
      <li>MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.ITab_MindMappingDetails</li>
    </inspectorTabs>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
